 "headline": "Wemby Drops 43 And Still Loses Big",
 "notes": [
  "Victor Wembanyama put up 43 points and 6 blocks for Nova Knicks, and they still trail theInfamous 8-3, which takes real talent.",
  "LeParth James left Anfernee Simons on the bench for 19 points, 5 threes and 3 steals, then watched Stephon Castle shoot 0-4.",
  "Darius Acuff Jr. hit 9 threes for 38 points, and theInfamous carried Dennis Schr\u00f6der's 1-11 shooting without noticing the damage.",
  "Gopher Gold finished first in the nightly rankings, and MONSTARS \u2604\ufe0f finished last, so the 7-3 score undersells the beating.",
